  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Sanitation Program I</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa Nac de Agua Potable y Alcantarillado I</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE NATIONAL POTABLE AND SEWERAGE PROGRAM WOULD INCLUDE: (I) POTABLE WATER TO MONTEVIDEO AREA; (II) SEWERAGE IN SMALL TOWN; (III) SUPPORT THE PROGRAM TO REGIONALIZED THE SANITARY WORKS MANAGEMENT BY (OSE); AND (IV) STUDIES FOR THE FINAL SOLUTION TO THE SEWERAGE AND POTABLE WATER SYSTEMS USING SOURCES OF THE PROGRAM.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
